flowchart LR
    subgraph M1["Approval · conservative by default, looser as you go"]
        A1["Destructive / outward-facing actions<br/>all ask by default"] --> A2["The owner says<br/>'no need to ask for this kind again'"] --> A3["Written to memory<br/>done directly next time"]
        A4["Timeout = denial<br/>no ask, no action"] -.-> A1
    end
    subgraph M2["Memory · understands you better over time"]
        B1["Preferences<br/>résumés always go in Documents/简历/"]
        B2["Facts<br/>the working directory is ~/work"]
        B3["Authorisations<br/>tidying the Downloads folder needs no asking"]
    end
    subgraph M3["Proactive · from answering to running the house"]
        C1["Scheduled<br/>reads the day's calendar at 8am"]
        C2["Event-driven<br/>disk full · backup failed"]
        C3["Long task finished<br/>says so on its own"]
    end
    subgraph M4["Multi-device · no implicit guessing"]
        D1["Aliases<br/>the one at home / the PC at work"]
        D2["Default = the hub itself"]
        D3["Offline is stated as offline"]
    end
    classDef box fill:#D9F2E3,stroke:#34A853,stroke-width:2px,color:#0B3D1E
    classDef warn fill:#FFE0E0,stroke:#E5484D,stroke-width:2px,color:#6B0F14
    class A1,A2,A3,B1,B2,B3,C1,C2,C3,D1,D2,D3 box
    class A4 warn
style M1 fill:#F8F9FA,stroke:#ADB5BD,stroke-width:1px
style M2 fill:#F8F9FA,stroke:#ADB5BD,stroke-width:1px
style M3 fill:#F8F9FA,stroke:#ADB5BD,stroke-width:1px
style M4 fill:#F8F9FA,stroke:#ADB5BD,stroke-width:1px
